<title>GREECE: STATE APPOINTS NEW ELTA BOARD OF DIRECTORS.</title>
<headline>STATE APPOINTS NEW ELTA BOARD OF DIRECTORS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Economy Minister Yannos</p>
<p>Papandoniou and Transport and Communications Minister Haralambos</p>
<p>Kastanidis appointed the new board of directors at Greece's post</p>
<p>offices (ELTA).</p>
<p>The new board is the following:</p>
<p>Athanasios Dimitrakopoulos, lawyer</p>
<p>Theodoros Kapetanakis, bank employee</p>
<p>Efi Sotiriou, architect</p>
<p>Vassilis Tsinaslanidis, economist</p>
<p>Modestos Athanasiadis, tradesman</p>
<p>Myrsini Tsahpini, Finance ministry employee</p>
<p>Dimitrios Roukos and Ioannis Lepeniotis, union reps</p>
<p>Anastasios Nakas, member of KEDKE board of directors</p>
<p>Vassilis Papadimitriou, mayor of Galatsi</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
